# This app intentionally reads the existing BTCPay credentials from
# ../../labs/lightning-btcpay-bridge/.env.local. Never copy credentials into src/.
# Server-side runtime flags. Research defaults are ALL OFF.
# PORT=8790
# ENABLE_ORDER_CREATION=1
# ENABLE_WALLET_PAY=0
# BITCOIN_NETWORK=testnet
# BTCPAY_WEBHOOK_SECRET=... (in existing private .env.local)
